{"id":"vod_md_7591","vodId":"7591","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐OAD","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐OAD","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20240228-1/1c8885cdc17e9bc01b7a686dcf88d703.jpg"},"summary":"《kiss×sis》（常用译名：亲吻姐姐）的原作者是日本漫画家Ditama某（ぢたま某）。漫画本来是《别册YOUNG MAGAZINE》在2004年1月推出的一部短篇，但由于受到读者好评，故在《别册YOUNG MAGAZINE》13号开始正式连载，2007年9月首次单行本化，推出后即买断货，曾多次重版，成为了此类漫画的爱好者之间的热门作品。2008年《别册Young Magazine》28号宣布本漫画即将动画化。\r\n由于附带OAD的第三卷初回限定版大受欢迎，早早预售完，官方决定制作OAD第二弹，随2009年5月22日发行的单行本第4卷初回限定版发售。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-02-28 08:54:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/VunZHwxL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/y5fZkGaz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/D4acfZmY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/Etpsu0Tf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/8iORJrPb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/AqCMExV7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/Bu2yKvcf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/xiQkMOyR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/YbbkdKzw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/O2o0TB1T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/P9VgcqLD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/z5Gg2QEJ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:20.270Z"}